{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"chenghuang-e-o090","title":"太妃引见张昭袭等问江东安否袭对","accounts":[{"id":"chenghuang-a-383a4bef28e3aef66d39","label":"正文","text":"太妃引见张昭袭等问江东安否袭对","evidence":["chenghuang-q-bf112d116ec72279ebfd"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0008","role":"对曰江东地势有山川之固而讨逆明府恩德在民讨虏承基大小用命张昭秉众事袭等为爪牙此地利人和之时也万无所忧","evidence":["chenghuang-q-bf112d116ec72279ebfd"]},{"person":"wendi-p0133","role":"被引见者","evidence":["chenghuang-q-bf112d116ec72279ebfd"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0018","role":"忧之、引见张昭及袭等问江东可保安否","evidence":["chenghuang-q-bf112d116ec72279ebfd"]},{"person":"wudi-p0099","role":"薨","evidence":["chenghuang-q-bf112d116ec72279ebfd"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"年少初统事","evidence":["chenghuang-q-bf112d116ec72279ebfd"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["chenghuang-q-bf112d116ec72279ebfd"]},"ordering_evidence":"chenghuang-q-bf112d116ec72279ebfd","source_order":[55,177,0],"order":9855}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0133","name":"张昭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0099","name":"孙策","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0008","name":"董袭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhouyu-p0018","name":"孙权母（本篇未具名）","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chenghuang-q-bf112d116ec72279ebfd","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-de3662f0e4df848abd29","layer":"original","quote":"策薨，权年少，初统事。太妃忧之，引见张昭及袭等，问：“江东可保安否？”袭对曰：“江东地势，有山川之固；而讨逆明府〖4〗，恩德在民。讨虏承基〖5〗，大小用命；张昭秉众事，袭等为爪牙。此地利、人和之时也！万无所忧。”众皆壮其言","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":176,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
